<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fili</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa kidodo kwa Filimoni yeisimbilwe na mnjagila Paulo musula lya 1.1. Paulo akali mukihopo peakali isimba, iyi iwonesa kuva baluwa iyi akasimbile peagehe ku Loma. Ngita akali ku Loma ndakyene, suwe iwesekanika dakisimbilwe ngita mwaka va sitini na yimwi peababilwe Kilisito suwe, ndeni ata baluwa kwa Vakolosai kikasimbilwe chipindi ichi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo akamsimbiliye baluwa iyi munu yumwi yeakemeliwe Filimoni. Filimoni akali yumwi pagati lya lipinga lya vanu yevamdikiye Kilisito na akali na vasutu. Paulo akamsimbiliye baluwa iyi neke kumsuka abihile kumtova msutu vake Onesimo yeakali anyilile kuhuma kwa Filimoni. Kwa malagilicho gya Valoma giwesa kugita Filimoni kumdocha Onesimo. Paulo akumlongela kwa kumsuka na kumnamacha Filimoni neke amdikiye Onesimo kuva mkolo yeamdikiye Kilisito, kangi amdikiye agite kasi pamwi na Paulo mu sula lya 1.13-14.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo akumuhungila Filimoni mu sula lya 1.1-3.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo akumsuka Filimoni amuwanuke Onesimo ngita mkolo vake yeamdikiye Kilisito mu sula lya 1.4-21.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo imalila kwa kumlagilichiya luhingilo na kumlongela kuva idobokela kuwuya kangi mu sula lya 1.22-25.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Baluwa iyi ndi kuhuma kwa nene Paulo, muwopwa kwajili lya Kilisito Yesu na kuhuma kwa Timotewo lukolo vetu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Ndikukusimbila baluwa veve Filimoni mganja vetu na mnyigendwa muyetu, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />veve muhacha Afia na Alikipo mpuga muyetu mu Kilisito na lipinga lya vanu vevamwidikiye Kilisito, lyelitang'ana mukaye lyako.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Tukuvang'ang'ila usangi na lutengamaso kuhuma kwa Nguluvi, Daada vetu na kwa Mtwa Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukelo na ludikilo lwa Filimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Kila chipindi pendikumlumba Nguluvi ndikukuviwuka veve Filimoni na ndikumuhongecha Nguluvi, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />kwakuva ndipulika njowo cha kwidikila kwa veve kwa Mtwa Yesu na lukelo lwako kwa vang'alile vonda va vevahaguliwe kwajili lya mdikiye Nguluvi. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Ndikukulumba neke udikilo ulo veugita pamwi na nefwe yikutange kuchela hilo lufunyo chonda chetukwanuka kwa kuhumila na kwiwungana na Kilisito. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Lukolo vangu, ukelo vako undiletie lukelo ngomi na kuninamacha hilo. Veve nondee ubuludise numbula cha vanu vevahaguliwe kwajili lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo akumlumbila Onesimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Kwakuwa ndiwesile kwa ukakatima hilo, ata ngita ndikuswitilicha mu Kilisito, ugite cheung'ang'wa kugita, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />ila kwakuva lya lukelo, ndi ngiba hilo ndikusuke. Ndigita ndena kwakuva nene Paulo ata ngita ndi mvaha na kangi nene ndi muwopwa kwajili lya Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Suwe, ndukusuka kwajili lya Onesimo, mwene ndi mwana vangu, ambaye ndivechile daada vake mu Kilisito pendigehe mukiwopo. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Nde Onesimo yuyula ambayo kigono kya kumbele seakutangile kinu kyokyonda, ila kwa nondee akukutanga veve na akunitanga na nene.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Nondee ndikumlagilicha kwa veve, kwakuva ndikumkela kwa numbula lyangu lyonda. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Ndikeliye akale na nene baha anditange badili lyako chipindi pendigehe mukiwopo kwakuva lya kulanducha Njowo Nofu, <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />ila dasendigita kyokyonda bila veve kudikila, sendikela kukuswitilicha unditangile, kwakuva usanzi vako wing'ang'wa kuhuma mu numbula lyako veve yuve na sekwakuswitilichwa na munu. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Pangi Onesimo akahegile kwa veve kwa chipindi chidodo, neke uveche pamwi nave mbepali, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />nondee mwene se msutu hela, ila ndi ngiba kuchumba msutu, mwene ndi lukolo mkelwa. Ndi munu yendimkeliye hilo, ila veve dakumkela hilo, ngita msutu na ngita lukolo mu Mtwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Kwakuva ukunichela kuva nene ndi mgita kasi myago mu Kilisito, mwanuke Onesimo ngita fila ngauniwanuka nene lukolo vako. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Ngita akali akugitile nongwa lyolyonda awu akali na deni lyako suwe ndilongele nene ndikuhombe. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Ndisimba luchowo ulu kwa liwoko lyangu, nene Paulo dandihomba! Kangi ndihela kwakuva lya kukwiwusa kuva una deni pakyanya lya kwikala kwa veve. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Ndakyene lukolo vangu, ugite luchowo ulu kwa ajili lya litawa lya Mtwa, ndikusuka ukeduse numbula lyangu ngita lukolo vako mu Kilisito. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Ndisimba kwa kwidikila kuva ndichela daudikila lusoko lyangu, ndena ndichele kuwa daugita makomi hilo kugina ago ndikusukile. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Pamwi na ago, nditayalisiye kyumba cha kufikila kwakuva ndihuvila kuva mukulumba kwa nyenye, Nguluvi akunitanga ndache kwa nyenye.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhungilo lwa kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafula, muwopwa muyangu kwajili lya Kilisito Yesu akuhungila. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Na vangita kasi pamwi na nene kina, Maliko na Alisitaliko na Dema na Luka vakuhungila.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Ndikuvang'ang'ila nyenye vonda usangi va Mtwa Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>